d="00:26.960">even </span><span begin="00:26.960" end="00:27.140">in </span><span begin="00:27.140" end="00:27.290">the </span><span begin="00:27.290" end="00:29.120">evening </span><span begin="00:29.120" end="00:29.750">cause </span><span begin="00:29.750" end="00:30.200">I've </span><span begin="00:30.200" end="00:31.310">been </span><span begin="00:31.310" end="00:32.660">drinking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.530" end="00:43.460"><span begin="00:33.530" end="00:34.010">Not </span><span begin="00:34.010" end="00:34.100">in </span><span begin="00:34.100" end="00:34.190">the </span><span begin="00:34.190" end="00:36.230">morning </span><span begin="00:36.230" end="00:36.680">when </span><span begin="00:36.680" end="00:37.130">your </span><span begin="00:37.130" end="00:37.390">*</span><span begin="00:37.390" end="00:37.650">*</span><span begin="00:37.650" end="00:37.910">*</span><span begin="00:37.910" end="00:38.180">* </span><span begin="00:38.180" end="00:40.130">works</span><span begin="00:40.130" end="00:43.460">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.460" end="00:45.950"><span begin="00:43.460" end="00:43.820">It's </span><span begin="00:43.820" end="00:44.570">always </span><span begin="00:44.570" end="00:45.950">dangerous</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.980" end="00:53.840"><span begin="00:45.980" end="00:46.550">When </span><span begin="00:46.550" end="00:47.480">everybody's </span><span begin="00:47.480" end="00:49.490">sleeping </span><span begin="00:49.490" end="00:49.910">and </span><span begin="00:49.910" end="00:50.750">I've </span><span begin="00:50.750" end="00:51.260">been </span><span begin="00:51.260" end="00:53.390">thinking</span><span begin="00:53.390" end="00:53.840">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.840" end="00:56.450"><span begin="00:53.840" end="00:54.170">Can </span><span begin="00:54.170" end="00:54.380">we </span><span begin="00:54.380" end="00:54.920">be </span><span begin="00:54.920" end="00:56.450">